.el .ds Aq '
.TH focusforge-cli-review 1  "review 0.1.0-rc.2" 
.SH NAME
focusforge\-cli\-review \- Report one record per result found under a directory of projects, or a batch run\*(Aqs output directory: identity, outcome, sharpness ratio and Z\-Map spread, with a failed stack a visible record rather than a missing file. Reads a run manifest when one is present, otherwise a non\-recursive listing of `*.ffp` files; never groups frames itself and writes nothing
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfocusforge\-cli review\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-v \fR]... [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIDIR\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Report one record per result found under a directory of projects, or a batch run\*(Aqs output directory: identity, outcome, sharpness ratio and Z\-Map spread, with a failed stack a visible record rather than a missing file. Reads a run manifest when one is present, otherwise a non\-recursive listing of `*.ffp` files; never groups frames itself and writes nothing
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit one wrapped JSON document instead of a human\-readable table
.TP
\fB\-v\fR
Increase log detail (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Log errors only
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIDIR\fR>
Directory to review: a run\*(Aqs `\-o` output, or a plain directory of `*.ffp` projects
.SH VERSION
v0.1.0\-rc.2
